{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47550","headline":"七言 五十九 · 吕岩","name":"七言 五十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"头角苍浪声似钟，貌如冰雪骨如松。\n匣中宝剑时频吼，袖里金鎚逞露风。\n会饮酒时爲伴侣，能行诗句便参同。\n来年定赴蓬莱会，骑个生狞九色龙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}